  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "\u0110\u1EA5u s\u0129"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Fearsome], [Play], [Last
    Breath]\r\n- Khi tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i ta, G\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1EB1ng
    m\u1ED9t n\u1EEDa m\xE1u c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD, l\xE0m tr\xF2n l\xEAn.\r\n- Khi ta
    ch\u1EBFt, \u0110\u01B0a ta v\u1EC1 tay."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 D\u1EA1 xoa \u2014 qu\u1EF7 th\u1EA7n chi\u1EBFn c\xF3 g\u1ED1c
    t\u1EEB Ph\u1EADt gi\xE1o, \u0111i v\xE0o truy\u1EC7n k\u1EC3 Vi\u1EC7t v\u1EDBi
    th\xE2n h\xECnh l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE1ng, nanh s\u1EEBng d\u1EEF t\u1EE3n. C\xF3
    chuy\u1EC7n xem ta l\xE0 l\xEDnh canh c\xF5i \xE2m ho\u1EB7c k\u1EBB b\u1EAFt
    h\u1ED3n."
